@startuml
title One callplot run through the modules
hide footbox
participant "User" as p1
participant "CLI" as p2
participant "render" as p3
participant "Flow" as p4
participant "IR" as p5
participant "renderers" as p6
p1 -> p2 : (1) callplot ~-html fred
p2 --> p1 : (2) exit 0
p2 -> p2 : read argv, files, stdin
p2 -> p3 : (3) text, mode, opts, ctx
p3 -> p4 : (4) parse, options, layout
p4 -> p3 : (5) laid out Flow
p4 -> p6 : (6) picture: text, pic, svg, vml, graffle, tables
p6 -> p3 : (7) picture string
p4 -> p5 : (8) buildModel after layout
p5 -> p6 : (9) title, participants, events
p6 -> p3 : (10) SVG page with linked table
p6 -> p2 : (11) write stdout
note right of p4 : numbering and position math live here
note right of p6 : jcompat.js gives Java semantics everywhere
@enduml
